S.P.A.

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:24.280
Interactive.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.440
This is the Software Publishers Association's website.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:28.400
You can find out all about their activities.

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.960
And by the time you view this, you can click on list of winners here and get a list of

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:35.960
all the Cody Award recipients for this year, not just the online categories, but all of

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:36.960
the categories.

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:42.520
And speaking of winners, let's go to the winner of the best internet or online service or

00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:46.040
product, and that went to the Netscape Navigator LAN edition.

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:49.160
Here we are at Netscape Communications' website, and if you want to get an idea of what the

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:51.960
Netscape Navigator looks like, look at some of these buttons up here.

00:22:51.960 --> 00:22:54.360
That happens to be the browser I'm using at the moment.

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:58.680
At Netscape's website here, you can find out all sorts of information about them and their

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:00.760
products, and one little treasure I'll tell you about.

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.400
If you do a little bit of looking, you'll be able to find Jim Clark's home page here.

